# Netlify rewrites (SECURITY_PLAN.md §3.1).
#
# 1. Same-origin API: with VITE_API_URL=/api the browser talks to
#    bigwhales.netlify.app/api/... and Netlify proxies to the Render service, so
#    the session cookies are first-party (Safari drops cross-site cookies).
#    Adjust the host if the Render service is renamed.
/api/*  https://brrrrdealanalyzer.onrender.com/:splat  200
# 2. The SPA fallback (vue-router history mode). Previously configured only in
#    the Netlify UI; kept in the repo so it is reviewable and restorable.
/*      /index.html   200
